// cycle — three-inlet merge (technology-mapping variant).
// Purpose: Same connectivity stand-in as GraphCoverage/cycle for the tech-mapping suite.
// Topology: FLOW: `input1+input2+input3` → `out`.
// Collaborator takeaway: Tech-mapping suite twin of the graph-coverage merge case.
module Cycle(
    finput input1, input2, input3,  // FLOW inlet(s)
    foutput out  // FLOW outlet(s)
);
    assign out = input1 + input2 + input3;  // FLOW merge / mix
endmodule
